  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "cassim-bell.liberation.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "cassim-bell.liberation.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.liberation.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.liberation.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "契約を終わらせる夜。場所は、七つの扉の廊下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.liberation.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.liberation.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "私の手には解除届と——所有者用の合鍵。保管庫の扉の鍵は「所有者」の私が預かる建前だった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.liberation.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.liberation.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1wuvexi",
      "speakerName": "カシム・ベル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "解除のお手続きですね。書式は完璧です。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.liberation.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.liberation.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1wuvexi",
      "speakerName": "カシム・ベル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……さすがに、私が仕込んだだけのことはある。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.liberation.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.liberation.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "解除届の書き方は、全部彼に教わった。教わった書式で、教えた本人を自由にする。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.liberation.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.liberation.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "世の中で一番きれいな書類仕事だと思う。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "cassim-bell.liberation.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "cassim-bell.liberation.asset.still.001"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "cassim-bell.liberation.node.direction.003",
      "command": {
        "type": "effect",
        "effectId": "pulse"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.liberation.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.liberation.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "判を押し、合鍵を返す。彼の手の中で、鍵は一瞬光って、鍵飾りの輪へ七本目として収まった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.liberation.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.liberation.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "七つの世界の鍵が、初めて全部、持ち主の手に揃った。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.liberation.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.liberation.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1wuvexi",
      "speakerName": "カシム・ベル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "これで、手続きは完了です。……いえ。最後に、一件だけ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.liberation.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.liberation.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1wuvexi",
      "speakerName": "カシム・ベル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "本日、遺失物のお届けが、あなた宛てに入っています。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.liberation.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.liberation.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "私宛て?　落とし物なんて、した覚え……"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.liberation.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.liberation.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "差し出された受付票を読んで、言葉が止まった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.liberation.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.liberation.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "品名欄——「受付係カシム・ベルの休憩時間(推定・数百年ぶん)」拾得者欄——「ミミ」",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.liberation.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.liberation.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1wuvexi",
      "speakerName": "カシム・ベル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "私が失くしていたものを、あなたが拾ってくれたので。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.liberation.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.liberation.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1wuvexi",
      "speakerName": "カシム・ベル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "規定により、拾得者には——お礼をする決まりです。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.liberation.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.liberation.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……お礼って、何をくれるんですか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "cassim-bell.liberation.node.direction.004",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "cassim-bell.liberation.asset.still.002"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "cassim-bell.liberation.node.direction.005",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "cassim-bell.liberation.asset.still.003"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.liberation.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.liberation.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1wuvexi",
      "speakerName": "カシム・ベル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "取り戻した休憩の、最初の十五分を。……これからも、あなたと。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.liberation.node.line.010b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.liberation.line.010b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1wuvexi",
      "speakerName": "カシム・ベル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "それが、一番価値のある使い道なので。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.liberation.node.line.011a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.liberation.line.011a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "受付のプロは、お礼の書式まで完璧だった。耳が熱くて、廊下の照明がにじむ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.liberation.node.line.011b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.liberation.line.011b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "契約は終わって、茶会の予定だけが残った。世の中の手続きが全部こうならいいのに。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.liberation.node.line.012a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.liberation.line.012a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "帰り際、締めの形だけ、二人で決めることにした。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "id": "cassim-bell.liberation.node.choice.001",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "cassim-bell.liberation.choice.001",
          "label": "所有者用の鍵を返し、倉庫の出口を本人へ渡す",
          "result": "七本の鍵が揃った夜、彼は保管庫の入口の札を書き換えた。「無限遺失物保管庫、管理者はカシム・ベル(自由業)」七世界の落とし物を守る自由業が開業。祝いは、持ち主不明の谷で現役組の弁当箱を使った茶会だった",
          "intent": "保管庫の主を、書類の上でも本人にする",
          "promise": "所有者名を消し、本人が自分の名で次の試合を選べるようにする。",
          "memory": "「自由業」の札を、七世界のお客様が祝ってくれた。",
          "tone": "defiant",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "relationship",
              "target": {
                "type": "fighter",
                "fighterId": "cassim-bell"
              },
              "mode": "add",
              "trust": 10,
              "ownership": 0
            },
            {
              "type": "liberationDecision",
              "fighterId": "cassim-bell",
              "decision": "release"
            }
          ],
          "goto": "cassim-bell.liberation.node.effect.001"
        },
        {
          "id": "cassim-bell.liberation.choice.002",
          "label": "契約を解き、チームの遺失物係を改めて頼む",
          "result": "「契約じゃなくて、係のお願いです。うちのチーム、物をよく失くすので」彼は即座に受付票を切った。「承りました。ただし当係の営業時間は、休憩時間を除く、です」休憩を除くと明記する受付係になった",
          "intent": "自由になった人へ、改めて係を頼む",
          "promise": "断る権利を返したうえで、チームの遺失物係という新しい約束を結ぶ。",
          "memory": "「休憩時間を除く」の但し書きを、チームの全員が音読した。",
          "tone": "tender",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "relationship",
              "target": {
                "type": "fighter",
                "fighterId": "cassim-bell"
              },
              "mode": "add",
              "trust": 6,
